msgid "Designed specifically for higher education governance, streamlining communication between Rectorate, Vice Rectors, Department Heads, and Employees."
msgstr "Oliy ta'lim boshqaruvi uchun maxsus ishlab chiqilgan bo'lib, Rektorat, Prorektorlar, Bo'lim boshliqlari va Xodimlar o'rtasidagi aloqani soddalashtiradi."

msgid "Operational Task Delegation"
msgstr "Operatsion vazifalarni topshirish"

msgid "Structured directives with clear department ownership, priorities, complexities, and enforced academic deadlines."
msgstr "Aniq bo'lim mas'uliyati, ustuvorliklar, murakkablik darajasi va belgilangan ijro muddatlariga ega tizimli topshiriqlar."

msgid "Two-Stage Approval System"
msgstr "Ikki bosqichli tasdiqlash tizimi"

msgid "Stage 1 Department Head verification followed by Stage 2 Vice Rector or Rector executive sign-off with mandatory review rationale."
msgstr "1-bosqich Bo'lim boshlig'i tekshiruvi va 2-bosqich Prorektor yoki Rektorning majburiy izohli yakuniy tasdiqlashi."

msgid "Protected Evidence Vault"
msgstr "Himoyalangan dalillar ombori"

msgid "Folder-based file management, PDF/DOCX/XLSX work reports, and immutable proof of completion for approved submissions."
msgstr "Papkalar asosida fayllarni boshqarish, PDF/DOCX/XLSX hisobotlari va tasdiqlangan topshiriqlar uchun o'zgarmas ijro dalillari."

msgid "Executive & Dept Dashboards"
msgstr "Rahbariyat va bo'lim panellari"

msgid "Live workload metrics, overdue task tracking, completion ratios, and structured operational work centers."
msgstr "Real vaqtdagi yuklama ko'rsatkichlari, muddati o'tgan vazifalar monitoringi, bajarilish foizlari va operatsion ish markazlari."

msgid "Instant Real-Time Alerts"
msgstr "Tezkor real vaqt bildirishnomalari"

msgid "Automated in-app alerts on new task assignments, submission status changes, review feedback, and deadline reminders."
msgstr "Yangi topshiriqlar, holat o'zgarishlari, tekshiruv xulosalari va ijro muddatlari haqida avtomatik tizim bildirishnomalari."

msgid "Institutional Security & RBAC"
msgstr "Institutsional xavfsizlik va RBAC"

msgid "Technical Superadmin separation, department-scoped authorization, IDOR protection, and complete audit logging."
msgstr "Texnik superadmin ajratilishi, bo'limlar bo'yicha ruxsatlar, IDOR himoyasi va to'liq audit jurnali."

msgid "Lifecycle Flow"
msgstr "Ijro bosqichlari"

msgid "How Tasks Move from Directive to Approval"
msgstr "Topshiriqlarning yaratilishdan tasdiqlanishgacha bo'lgan yo'li"

msgid "A transparent, structured 5-stage lifecycle ensuring quality, accountability, and timely completion."
msgstr "Sifat, mas'uliyat va o'z vaqtida bajarilishini ta'minlovchi 5 bosqichli shaffof jarayon."

msgid "Directive Created"
msgstr "Topshiriq yaratish"

msgid "Rector or Vice Rector initiates a structured task with official deadline and department assignment."
msgstr "Rektor yoki Prorektor rasmiy muddat va mas'ul bo'limni belgilagan holda topshiriq yaratadi."

msgid "Dept Distribution"
msgstr "Bo'limda taqsimlash"

msgid "Department Head assigns responsible specialist employees with specific roles and instructions."
msgstr "Bo'lim boshlig'i mas'ul mutaxassis xodimlarga aniq ko'rsatmalar bilan vazifani biriktiradi."

msgid "Execution & Evidence"
msgstr "Bajarish va dalillar"

msgid "Employee updates progress (0-100%), attaches deliverables, and submits for Stage 1 approval."
msgstr "Xodim ijro jarayonini (0-100%) yangilaydi, hisobotlarni biriktiradi va 1-bosqich tasdig'iga yuboradi."

msgid "Dept Head Review"
msgstr "Bo'lim boshlig'i tekshiruvi"

msgid "Department Head reviews attached reports and either approves to Level 2 or returns with notes."
msgstr "Bo'lim boshlig'i biriktirilgan hisobotlarni ko'rib chiqadi va 2-bosqichga tasdiqlaydi yoki izoh bilan qaytaradi."

msgid "Executive Approval"
msgstr "Rahbariyat tasdig'i"

msgid "Vice Rector or Rector grants final approval, permanently locking verified evidence."
msgstr "Prorektor yoki Rektor yakuniy tasdiqni beradi va tekshirilgan dalillarni daxlsiz qilib arxivlaydi."

msgid "Institutional Integrity & Governance"
